' Expected: CIRCLE draws full circles, arcs, radius lines, ellipses and STEP-relative centers.
SCREEN 8
CLS

CIRCLE (180, 180), 70, 14
CIRCLE (180, 180), 95, 10, 0, PI
CIRCLE (180, 180), 120, 12, -PI / 4, PI * 3 / 4

PSET (360, 180), 15
CIRCLE STEP (80, 0), 55, 11, -PI / 2, PI / 2, 0.5
CIRCLE (600, 180), 90, 13, 0, PI * 2, 1.8

PRINT "Press ESC to return to Output"
DO WHILE NOT KEYPRESS("ESC")
LOOP
SCREEN 0
PRINT "Circle full forms sample finished"
